  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Social Protection Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to strengthen the policycomma management and administrative capacity in MOLSA and MOF to developcomma manage and monitor pension and social safety net reforms. Since this is a small Technical Assistance projectcomma which will be implemented over a short period of timecomma it will be difficult to measure final outcomes. One intermediate measure of success will be that both MOLSA and MOF are able to use information generated by the new systems for social safety net and pension decision making.</narrative>
  </description>
